  "interpretation": {
    "mechanism": "The idempotency INSERT foreign-key RI Key Share bypasses tuple-lock FIFO for the later project FOR NO KEY UPDATE lock. Waiters directly wait for each successive holder xid, so lock_timeout restarts per holder segment. Removing only that disposable FK restores tuple FIFO and produces a depth-19 55P03 cascade near 500ms.",
